@startuml Sequence_Timing_Auth
title Authentication Flow with Timing

actor User
participant Browser
participant Frontend
participant Backend
database DB

== 0-100ms: User Input ==
User -> Browser : Click login
Browser -> Frontend : Submit credentials

== 100-200ms: Frontend ==
Frontend -> Frontend : Validate form
Frontend -> Backend : POST /api/login

== 200-300ms: Backend ==
Backend -> DB : SELECT user (220ms)
DB --> Backend : User data (240ms)
Backend -> Backend : Verify password (260ms)
Backend -> Backend : Generate JWT (280ms)
Backend --> Frontend : {token, user} (300ms)

== 300-350ms: Complete ==
Frontend -> Frontend : Store token (320ms)
Frontend --> Browser : Redirect (350ms)

@enduml

@startuml Sequence_Timing_API
title API Request with Timing

participant Client
participant Server
participant Auth
participant Controller
database DB

== 0-15ms: Request ==
Client -> Server : HTTP Request (10ms)
Server -> Auth : Verify JWT (15ms)

== 15-40ms: Auth ==
Auth -> Auth : Check token (30ms)
Auth -> Controller : Attach user (40ms)

== 40-75ms: Processing ==
Controller -> Controller : Check permission (50ms)
Controller -> DB : SQL Query (60ms)
DB --> Controller : Results (70ms)
Controller -> Controller : Format (75ms)

== 75-80ms: Response ==
Controller --> Server : Ready
Server --> Client : HTTP Response (80ms)

@enduml

@startuml Sequence_Timing_University
title University CRUD with Timing

actor Admin
participant React
participant API
participant Route
participant Ctrl
database DB

== 0-65ms: User Action ==
Admin -> React : Click Add (10ms)
React -> React : Open modal (30ms)
Admin -> React : Submit (60ms)
React -> React : Validate (65ms)

== 65-100ms: Backend ==
React -> API : POST /api/universities
API -> Route : Request (70ms)
Route -> Ctrl : Route (75ms)
Ctrl -> DB : INSERT (80ms)
DB --> Ctrl : New ID (90ms)
Ctrl --> API : 201 Created (95ms)
API --> React : Response (100ms)

== 100-105ms: UI ==
React -> React : Update UI
React --> Admin : Success (105ms)

@enduml

@startuml Sequence_Timing_JWT
title JWT Lifecycle with Timing

participant User
participant Auth
participant Token

== 0ms: Creation ==
User -> Auth : Login
Auth -> Token : Generate
Token --> User : Issue token

== 0-120ms: Active ==
User -> User : Browse (30ms)
User -> Auth : API call (90ms)
Auth -> Token : Verify
Token --> Auth : Valid

== 120-140ms: Refresh ==
Auth -> Token : Check expiry (120ms)
Auth -> Token : Refresh (140ms)
Token --> User : New token

== 250ms: Expired ==
User -> Auth : API call (250ms)
Auth -> Token : Verify
Token --> Auth : Expired!
Auth --> User : Redirect

@enduml

@startuml Sequence_Timing_Transaction
title Database Transaction with Timing

participant App
participant Pool
participant Tx
database DB

== 0-10ms ==
App -> Pool : Acquire (10ms)

== 10-90ms ==
Pool -> Tx : BEGIN (20ms)
Tx -> DB : INSERT 1 (30ms)
Tx -> DB : INSERT 2 (45ms)
Tx -> DB : INSERT 3 (60ms)

== 90-100ms ==
App -> Tx : COMMIT (90ms)
Tx -> DB : Persist
DB --> Tx : Complete
Tx --> Pool : Done
Pool --> App : Release (100ms)

@enduml

@startuml Sequence_Timing_Import
title CSV Import with Timing

participant FE
participant Parser
participant Validator
participant BE
database DB

== 0-80ms ==
FE -> FE : Read file (10ms)
FE -> Parser : Parse (20ms)
Parser --> FE : Data (60ms)
FE -> Validator : Validate (60ms)
Validator --> FE : Valid (80ms)

== 210-490ms ==
FE -> BE : POST import (210ms)
BE -> DB : BEGIN (220ms)
BE -> DB : INSERT 1 (230ms)
BE -> DB : INSERT 2 (240ms)
BE -> DB : INSERT N (260ms)
BE -> DB : COMMIT (470ms)
DB --> BE : Success (480ms)
BE --> FE : Complete (490ms)

@enduml

